            "notes": "DOERD (DÖRT / DOERT)  is a Germany-based Electronic Music Producer, whose prolific and varied output embodies a deliberate \"musical schizophrenia\" by encompassing a wide spectrum of genres. His repertoire seamlessly transitions between Deep House, Tech House, Melodic House, and Breakbeats to introspective soundscapes like Chillout, Ambient, and Easy Listening.\n\nHis signature sound is defined by deep chords, driving grooves, and pulsating rhythms. DOERD maintains the constant objective of creating tracks that resonate with audiences and \"generate excitement on the dance floor\", producing always with \"at least one ear and one eye at the dancefloor\".\n\nDOERD operates under the core philosophy: \"This music should not be defined by genres but solely by your ♥\"."
